{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34301","headline":"奉和袭美赠魏处士五贶诗 诃陵尊 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美赠魏处士五贶诗 诃陵尊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鱼骼匠成尊，犹残海浪痕。\n外堪欺玳瑁，中可酌崑仑。\n水绕苔矶曲，山当草阁门。\n此中醒复醉，何必问乾坤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34301.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34301","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}